. 1B).\n\n** Concluding with \u201cno classification\u201d based on the data generated for one of the key events is only possible when additional information is available to support the conclusion.", "metadata": {"doc_id": "62a43031-15cc-4d8e-93ed-5e423f52fd87", "content_type": "CompositeElement", "filename": "information_requirements_r7a_en.pdf"}}